{
  "$comment": [
    "Contrat unique entre le backend FastAPI et l'extension VS Code.",
    "",
    "Le risque qu'il ferme : backendClient.ts (interfaces TypeScript) et",
    "app/code/schemas.py + app/project/schemas.py (modeles Pydantic)",
    "decrivent le MEME contrat en deux endroits, sans lien mecanique. Une",
    "divergence ne se manifeste qu'a l'execution, chez l'utilisateur, sous",
    "la forme d'un champ vide ou d'un affichage de travers.",
    "",
    "Ce fichier est la troisieme copie — et la seule qui fasse autorite.",
    "Deux tests le lisent :",
    "",
    "  backend/tests/test_api_contract.py     compare au schema OpenAPI",
    "  vscode-extension/test/apiContract.test.ts  compare aux types TS",
    "",
    "Une divergence d'un cote OU de l'autre fait echouer un build. Modifier",
    "un contrat demande donc de modifier ce fichier, ce qui rend le",
    "changement visible en revue plutot que silencieux.",
    "",
    "`required` liste les champs dont les deux cotes dependent. Un champ",
    "present dans le code mais absent d'ici est tolere (le backend peut",
    "renvoyer plus que ce que l'extension lit) ; l'inverse est une erreur.",
    "",
    "`forbidden` liste les champs qui ne doivent JAMAIS apparaitre. Ce ne",
    "sont pas des oublis : ce sont des interdits de securite, verifies a",
    "chaque build.",
    "",
    "Phase 2 : detection de secrets, inventaire de dependances, analyse de",
    "vulnerabilites. Ces trois capacites sont INDEPENDANTES de Wazuh : aucune",
    "route de ce contrat n'appelle le Manager, l'Indexer ou l'API Wazuh, et",
    "toutes repondent a l'identique avec Wazuh arrete.",
    "",
    "Phase 6 : assistant IA de securite. Il EXPLIQUE des findings deja",
    "produits par les moteurs deterministes ; il n'en cree, n'en supprime et",
    "n'en requalifie aucun. Deux interdits nouveaux sont verifies a chaque",
    "build :",
    "",
    "  * aucun modele de sortie IA ne porte `severity`, `risk_score` ni",
    "    `status` — le modele n'a structurellement pas de champ ou ecrire",
    "    une decision ;",
    "  * toute reponse IA porte `ai_generated` et `disclaimer` — une",
    "    explication non marquee serait prise pour un constat verifie.",
    "",
    "L'assistant est OPTIONNEL : sans OPENAI_API_KEY, ses routes repondent",
    "503 avec une raison, et aucune autre route de ce contrat ne change de",
    "comportement.",
    "",
    "Phase 7 : remediation assistee. Le backend PROPOSE une modification",
    "bornee d'un fichier ; il n'ecrit ni le fichier ni le finding. La",
    "requete porte un EXTRAIT borne et expurge (`excerpt_lines`), objet meme",
    "de la route et jamais persiste. La reponse ne porte ni gravite ni",
    "statut : c'est la nouvelle analyse deterministe, apres application",
    "confirmee par l'utilisateur, qui dit si le probleme a disparu.",
    "",
    "Phase 8 : posture de securite et controle CI/CD. Lectures seules des",
    "findings et du contexte existants : aucun score, aucune IA, aucun",
    "Wazuh. Un domaine jamais analyse porte `findings: null`, jamais 0."
  ],
  "version": "1.4.0",
  "endpoints": {
    "GET /api/code/health": {
      "purpose": "Diagnostic. Seule route publique.",
      "authenticated": false,
      "response": {
        "model": "CodeHealth",
        "required": [
          "status",
          "analysis_enabled",
          "ai_enabled",
          "rules_version",
          "rules_count",
          "api_version",
          "max_content_bytes",
          "database",
          "auth_required",
          "project_context_enabled",
          "project_security_enabled"
        ]
      }
    },
    "POST /api/code/scan": {
      "purpose": "Analyse un document.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "request": {
        "model": "CodeScanRequest",
        "required": [
          "file_path",
          "language",
          "content",
          "content_hash",
          "workspace",
          "project_uid",
          "ai_enrichment"
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "model": "CodeScanResult",
        "required": [
          "scan_uid",
          "file_path",
          "language",
          "content_hash",
          "line_count",
          "rules_version",
          "analysis_status",
          "analysis_error",
          "findings",
          "findings_count",
          "counts",
          "cached",
          "ai_enrichment_requested",
          "ai_enrichment_applied"
        ]
      }
    },
    "POST /api/project/discover": {
      "purpose": "Enregistre un projet, retourne son identifiant stable.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "request": {
        "model": "ProjectDiscoverRequest",
        "required": [
          "root_hash",
          "project_name",
          "discovery_version"
        ],
        "forbidden": [
          "workspace_path",
          "root_path",
          "absolute_path"
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "model": "ProjectRegistration",
        "required": [
          "project_uid",
          "project_name",
          "root_hash",
          "status",
          "known",
          "last_discovery"
        ]
      }
    },
    "POST /api/project/{project_uid}/index": {
      "purpose": "Soumet l'index du projet, recoit le contexte recalcule.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "request": {
        "model": "ProjectIndexRequest",
        "required": [
          "files",
          "manifests",
          "git",
          "discovered_count",
          "truncated",
          "warnings",
          "discovery_version"
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "model": "ProjectSecurityContext"
      }
    },
    "GET /api/project/{project_uid}/context": {
      "purpose": "Relit le contexte enregistre.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "response": {
        "model": "ProjectSecurityContext"
      }
    },
    "GET /api/security/health": {
      "purpose": "Capacites du moteur de securite projet.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "response": {
        "model": "SecurityEngineHealth",
        "required": [
          "status",
          "secret_detection_enabled",
          "dependency_inventory_enabled",
          "vulnerability_check_enabled",
          "vulnerability_provider",
          "supported_ecosystems",
          "requires_wazuh"
        ]
      }
    },
    "POST /api/project/{project_uid}/secrets": {
      "purpose": "Enregistre un balayage de secrets realise sur le poste.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "request": {
        "model": "SecretScanSubmission",
        "required": [
          "findings",
          "scanned_files",
          "skipped_files",
          "engine",
          "engine_version",
          "truncated",
          "warnings"
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "model": "SecretScanResult",
        "required": [
          "project_uid",
          "findings",
          "statistics",
          "warnings"
        ]
      }
    },
    "POST /api/project/{project_uid}/api-security": {
      "purpose": "Enregistre une analyse de securite d'API realisee sur le poste.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "request": {
        "model": "ApiScanSubmission",
        "required": [
          "findings",
          "scanned_files",
          "endpoints_detected",
          "engine",
          "engine_version",
          "truncated",
          "warnings"
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "model": "ApiScanResult",
        "required": [
          "project_uid",
          "findings",
          "statistics",
          "warnings"
        ]
      }
    },
    "POST /api/project/{project_uid}/dependencies": {
      "purpose": "Enregistre l'inventaire des dependances et, si possible, le verifie.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "request": {
        "model": "DependencyInventorySubmission",
        "required": [
          "dependencies",
          "manifests_read",
          "truncated",
          "warnings",
          "inventory_version",
          "check_vulnerabilities"
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "model": "DependencyScanResult",
        "required": [
          "project_uid",
          "findings",
          "dependency_statistics",
          "vulnerability_statistics",
          "ecosystems",
          "warnings"
        ]
      }
    },
    "GET /api/project/{project_uid}/findings": {
      "purpose": "Findings de securite d'un projet, toutes familles confondues.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "response": {
        "model": "SecurityFinding"
      }
    },
    "GET /api/security/ai/health": {
      "purpose": "Etat de l'assistant IA de securite. Consultee avant d'afficher un bouton IA : proposer une action qui repondra 503 coute plus cher que de ne rien proposer.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "response": {
        "model": "SecurityAiHealth",
        "required": [
          "status",
          "available",
          "chat_available",
          "provider_configured",
          "assistant_enabled",
          "chat_enabled",
          "model",
          "reason",
          "disclaimer",
          "max_context_findings",
          "modifies_findings",
          "modifies_severity",
          "requires_wazuh",
          "fix_available"
        ]
      }
    },
    "POST /api/project/{project_uid}/findings/{finding_id}/ai-analysis": {
      "purpose": "Fait expliquer un finding EXISTANT. N'ecrit jamais dans security_findings et ne change aucune gravite.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "response": {
        "model": "SecurityFindingAiAnalysis",
        "required": [
          "finding_id",
          "project_uid",
          "ai_generated",
          "disclaimer",
          "model",
          "analyzed_at",
          "cached",
          "category",
          "deterministic_severity",
          "deterministic_confidence",
          "deterministic_title",
          "detection_engine",
          "explanation",
          "why_it_matters",
          "project_impact",
          "evidence_interpretation",
          "recommendation",
          "remediation_steps",
          "secure_example",
          "related_concepts",
          "developer_summary",
          "insufficient_context",
          "missing_information",
          "confidence",
          "project_context_available",
          "related_findings_considered"
        ],
        "forbidden": [
          "severity",
          "risk_score",
          "status",
          "evidence"
        ]
      }
    },
    "POST /api/project/{project_uid}/ai/summary": {
      "purpose": "Resume plusieurs findings d'un projet et en donne les relations. Annonce toujours sa couverture.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "request": {
        "model": "SecurityAiSummaryRequest",
        "required": [
          "finding_ids"
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "model": "SecurityFindingsAiSummary",
        "required": [
          "project_uid",
          "ai_generated",
          "disclaimer",
          "model",
          "analyzed_at",
          "summary",
          "themes",
          "relationships",
          "priority_order",
          "insufficient_context",
          "missing_information",
          "findings_considered",
          "findings_available",
          "truncated",
          "severity_counts",
          "project_context_available"
        ],
        "forbidden": [
          "severity",
          "risk_score",
          "status"
        ]
      }
    },
    "POST /api/project/{project_uid}/ai/chat": {
      "purpose": "Repond a une question sur la securite du projet ouvert, depuis son contexte et ses findings. La question renvoyee est la version EXPURGEE, celle qui est reellement partie.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "request": {
        "model": "SecurityChatRequest",
        "required": [
          "question",
          "history"
        ],
        "forbidden": [
          "content",
          "file_content",
          "workspace",
          "api_key",
          "token"
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "model": "SecurityChatResponse",
        "required": [
          "project_uid",
          "ai_generated",
          "disclaimer",
          "model",
          "answered_at",
          "question",
          "answer",
          "insufficient_context",
          "missing_information",
          "related_concepts",
          "findings_considered",
          "findings_available",
          "truncated",
          "project_context_available",
          "history_turns_used"
        ],
        "forbidden": [
          "severity",
          "risk_score",
          "status"
        ]
      }
    },
    "POST /api/project/{project_uid}/findings/{finding_id}/ai-fix": {
      "purpose": "Propose un correctif borne pour un finding EXISTANT. N'ecrit aucun fichier et aucun finding ; `available: false` dit pourquoi aucun correctif automatique n'est sur.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "request": {
        "model": "SecurityFixRequest",
        "required": [
          "file_path",
          "content_hash",
          "language",
          "target_line",
          "excerpt_start_line",
          "excerpt_lines"
        ],
        "forbidden": [
          "content",
          "file_content",
          "api_key",
          "token",
          "workspace"
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "model": "SecurityFixProposal",
        "required": [
          "finding_id",
          "project_uid",
          "kind",
          "ai_generated",
          "disclaimer",
          "model",
          "generated_at",
          "category",
          "deterministic_severity",
          "deterministic_title",
          "available",
          "refusal",
          "file",
          "base_content_hash",
          "start_line",
          "end_line",
          "replacement_lines",
          "explanation",
          "reason",
          "warnings",
          "manual_steps"
        ],
        "forbidden": [
          "severity",
          "risk_score",
          "status",
          "fixed",
          "command",
          "sql"
        ]
      }
    },
    "GET /api/project/{project_uid}/posture": {
      "purpose": "Posture de securite explicable par domaine. Aucun score ; « jamais analyse » (findings: null) distinct de « aucun finding ».",
      "authenticated": true,
      "response": {
        "model": "SecurityPosture",
        "required": [
          "project_uid",
          "project_name",
          "generated_at",
          "analysis",
          "findings",
          "areas",
          "coverage",
          "history",
          "ai_generated",
          "requires_ai",
          "requires_wazuh"
        ],
        "forbidden": [
          "score",
          "security_score",
          "grade",
          "rating",
          "risk_score",
          "evidence",
          "root_hash",
          "workspace_path",
          "secret",
          "token",
          "password"
        ]
      }
    },
    "POST /api/project/{project_uid}/ci-check": {
      "purpose": "Controle CI/CD deterministe. Politique off / warn / block (warn par defaut) ; un blocage porte toujours ses raisons. Sans IA ni Wazuh.",
      "authenticated": true,
      "request": {
        "model": "CiPolicyRequest",
        "required": [
